<h2 data-section-id="1euzjic" data-start="73" data-end="113"><span role="text">Step 1: <code data-start="84" data-end="92">images</code> folder আছে কিনা দেখো</span></h2>
<p data-start="115" data-end="147">তোমার project structure এমন হবে:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="149" data-end="334"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-ceb34a6c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0"><code><span>bup-student-portal/
│
├── index.html
├── services.html
├── events.html
├── about.html
├── contact.html
│
├── css/
│   └── style.css
│
├── js/
│   └── script.js
│
└── images/</span></code></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="336" data-end="355">না থাকলে VS Code-এ:</p>
<p data-start="357" data-end="413"><strong data-start="357" data-end="413">Project folder → Right Click → New Folder → <code data-start="403" data-end="411">images</code></strong></p>
<hr data-start="415" data-end="418">
<h2 data-section-id="eiuy9f" data-start="420" data-end="444">Step 2: 5টা ছবি লাগবে</h2>
<p data-start="446" data-end="472">এই নামগুলো দিয়ে ছবি রাখবে:</p>
<pre class="overflow-visible! px-0!" data-start="474" data-end="593"><div class="relative w-full mt-4 mb-1"><div class=""><div class="contents"><div class="relative"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0"><div class="h-full min-h-0 min-w-0" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"><div class="border border-token-border-light border-radius-3xl corner-superellipse/1.1 rounded-3xl"><div class="h-full w-full border-radius-3xl bg-(--code-block-surface) corner-superellipse/1.1 overflow-clip rounded-3xl [--code-block-surface:var(--bg-elevated-secondary)] dark:[--code-block-surface:var(--composer-surface-primary)] lxnfua_clipPathFallback"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute end-1.5 top-1 z-2 md:end-2 md:top-1"><button type="button" class="flex gap-1 items-center select-none pointer-events-auto py-2 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-black/5 dark:hover:bg-white/10 size-9 rounded-full px-2" aria-label="Copy" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" aria-hidden="true" class="icon-md"><use href="/cdn/assets/sprites-core-ceb34a6c.svg#7fccfb" fill="currentColor"></use></svg></button></div><div class="relative"><div class="pe-11 pt-3" style="transform: none;"><div class="relative z-0 flex max-w-full"><div id="code-block-viewer" dir="ltr" class="q9tKkq_viewer cm-editor z-10 light:cm-light dark:cm-light flex h-full w-full flex-col items-stretch ͼs ͼ16"><div class="cm-scroller"><pre class="cm-content q9tKkq_readonly m-0 PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer" style="--targeted-action-anchor-block-start: 22.666748046875px; --targeted-action-anchor-inline-start: 46.92706298828125px; --targeted-action-anchor-inline-size: 80.8125px; --targeted-action-anchor-block-size: 14.66650390625px;"><code><span>images/
├── bup-hero.jpg
├── bup-about.jpg
├── football-event.jpg
├── tech-event.jpg
└── cultural-event.jpg</span></code><span aria-hidden="true" class="PDq2pG_selectionAnchor"></span></pre></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=""><div class="" style="width: 100%; transform: none;"></div></div></div></div></div></div></pre>
<p data-start="595" data-end="647">ছবি download করে rename করে <code data-start="623" data-end="631">images</code> folder-এ রাখবে।</p>
<hr data-start="649" data-end="652">
<h1 data-section-id="19x23tm" data-start="654" data-end="693">Step 3: Home Page-এর Background Image</h1>
<p data-start="695" data-end="743"><code data-start="695" data-end="710">css/style.css</code> খুলে আগের <code data-start="721" data-end="736">.hero-section</code> খুঁজো।</p>
<p data-start="745" data-end="772">আগেরটা replace করে এটা দাও:</p>
